MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR VAULT (BLACK LANTERN):
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.

ONE ORGAN: a task slip whose line items branch. Mobile PWA, lives on a phone home screen.
Not a dashboard. Not stacked sections. Not a calendar.

PALETTE: Field #000000 · Paper #F4F4F0 · Ink #111111 · Cobalt #0000FF · Urgent #FF2B2B.
Paper is data. Black is the machine. Cobalt is the type and the chrome.
RED IS ONLY EVER THE HAND — the strike and [X]. Never decoration, never a third accent.
Cobalt on black does not read: the dock speaks in paper.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial. Nothing else.

COMPOSITION (mobile-first):
1. Paper slip, full column, bleeding off the top and bottom. No radius, no shadow, no cap. Not a card.
2. Masthead of real metadata: VAULT / long date + clock / SLIP #nnnn. Focus prints the path instead.
3. Rules are printed characters (::::, ----), not 1px borders.
4. Rows: ring dot settles · text selects (cobalt band, paper type) · + arms a child · right column is
   a settle time on a leaf or a roll-up ratio on a parent (tap it to fold) · red [X] kills the branch.
5. Children hang off DIAGONAL wires. No elbows, no indent rails, no ASCII corners. Chaos is seeded
   from the task text and must be identical every frame.
6. Totals, legend, KEEP FOR YOUR RECORDS, then BAD FORM in a distorted oval.
7. ONE one-line dock in the black gutter. Context comes from what you tapped. Never three forms.

FLOURISH: riso mis-registration only — a mark printed twice, a pixel or two apart, cobalt and red.
Stamp and masthead only. Never body text.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks, day cards, SaaS stacks, cards, rounded anything, calendars, the globe seal,
beige cassette chrome, amber or green terminals, ├── elbows, indent guide rails, paper texture,
torn edges, barcodes, macOS window chrome, LCD display fonts, emoji, a second input form.
